{
  "name": "04 · Extracción de facturas con revisión humana",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 · Extracción de facturas\n\n1. Credenciales: Anthropic API, Google Sheets (OAuth2) y Gmail (OAuth2).\n2. Pestañas: \"Facturas validadas\", \"Facturas dudosas\" y \"Facturas incompletas\".\n3. Cambia el destinatario de \"Pedir revisión humana\" por el email de tu contable.\n4. Envía en el body el campo texto_factura (texto plano del OCR o del PDF).",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "nodo-001",
      "name": "Nota · Configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "wf-04-factura-recibida",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo-002",
      "name": "Webhook factura",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        40,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// El texto de la factura llega dentro de body.texto_factura.\nconst b = $json.body ?? {};\nreturn [{ json: {\n  archivo: String(b.archivo ?? 'sin nombre').trim(),\n  texto_factura: String(b.texto_factura ?? '').trim().slice(0, 15000),\n  recibido_en: new Date().toISOString(),\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "nodo-003",
      "name": "Normalizar entrada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}"
      },
      "id": "nodo-004",
      "name": "Responder recepción",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.texto_factura }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo-005",
      "name": "¿Trae texto de factura?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            },
            {
              "name": "content-type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'claude-opus-5', max_tokens: 1024, system: \"Eres un asistente contable. Extrae datos de facturas espanolas. Responde SOLO con JSON valido con: proveedor, nif, numero_factura, fecha_factura (YYYY-MM-DD), base_imponible (numero), iva (numero), total (numero), moneda y confianza (numero entre 0 y 1). Si un dato no aparece, usa null y baja la confianza.\", messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'Extrae los campos de esta factura:\\n' + $json.texto_factura }] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo-006",
      "name": "Extraer campos con IA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        920,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Anthropic API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Interpreta el JSON de la IA y comprueba que base + IVA = total.\nconst bloque = ($json.content || []).find((b) => b.type === 'text');\nconst texto = bloque ? bloque.text : '';\nlet ia = {};\ntry {\n  ia = JSON.parse(texto.replace(/^\\s*```(?:json)?/i, '').replace(/```\\s*$/, '').trim());\n} catch (e) {\n  ia = { proveedor: null, confianza: 0 };\n}\nconst base = Number(ia.base_imponible ?? NaN);\nconst iva = Number(ia.iva ?? NaN);\nconst total = Number(ia.total ?? NaN);\nconst cuadra = [base, iva, total].every(Number.isFinite) && Math.abs(base + iva - total) < 0.02;\nconst original = $('Normalizar entrada').item.json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...original, ...Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(ia && typeof ia === 'object' && !Array.isArray(ia) ? ia : {}).filter(([key]) => !(key in original))), cuadra, confianza: Number(ia.confianza ?? 0) } }];"
      },
      "id": "nodo-007",
      "name": "Comprobar totales",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1140,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.cuadra }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.confianza }}",
              "rightValue": 0.8,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo-008",
      "name": "¿Fiable y cuadra?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REEMPLAZAR_ID_DOCUMENTO"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Facturas validadas"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "fecha_registro": "={{ $json.recibido_en }}",
            "archivo": "={{ $json.archivo }}",
            "proveedor": "={{ $json.proveedor }}",
            "nif": "={{ $json.nif }}",
            "numero_factura": "={{ $json.numero_factura }}",
            "fecha_factura": "={{ $json.fecha_factura }}",
            "base_imponible": "={{ $json.base_imponible }}",
            "iva": "={{ $json.iva }}",
            "total": "={{ $json.total }}",
            "confianza": "={{ $json.confianza }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo-009",
      "name": "Registrar validada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1580,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Google Sheets (OAuth2)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REEMPLAZAR_ID_DOCUMENTO"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Facturas dudosas"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "fecha_registro": "={{ $json.recibido_en }}",
            "archivo": "={{ $json.archivo }}",
            "proveedor": "={{ $json.proveedor }}",
            "total": "={{ $json.total }}",
            "confianza": "={{ $json.confianza }}",
            "motivo": "={{ $json.cuadra ? \"confianza baja\" : \"los importes no cuadran\" }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo-010",
      "name": "Registrar dudosa",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1580,
